      "title": "Where we left off",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 24 February Maya accepted the 12 year PPA term, but the 74/MWh floor sits above the 71/MWh that finance signed off; she asked for a reworked sensitivity table.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "email",
              "id": "E51"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 27 February Jonas asked that the board pre-read figures for Fenmoor stay consistent with the latest lender model.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "email",
              "id": "E56"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March Hannah asked to lead Thursday's pre-read with the pricing floor logic.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "email",
              "id": "E65"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "empty": false
    },
    {
      "id": "open_items",
      "title": "Open items",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Maya promised the grid-connection study by 6 March; it is still outstanding (Sam was still waiting on 4 March).",
