            {
              "type": "email",
              "id": "E51"
            },
            {
              "type": "chat",
              "id": "C26"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Northwind owes Maya a reworked sensitivity table at the 74/MWh and 71/MWh levels before the board pre-read circulates.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "email",
              "id": "E51"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The final board paper is due on 20 March 2026; the board meets on 24 March.",
          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "doc",
              "id": "D7"
            },
            {
              "type": "email",
              "id": "E38"
