          "citations": [
            {
              "type": "email",
              "id": "E51"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Risk: Ashgrove Bank needs the PPA signed before financial close on 30 June 2026, so slippage in the pricing work is costly.",
          "citations": [
